  ],
  "notes": "SAM-expanded fixture: data sources and connector policies are matched by type, and a raw-CFN template matches too. Read-write grants must sit on a role AppSync assumes (inline, or a policy attached either way); which data source uses which granting role needs a chain, and ref is single-hop. The adapter resolves Ref AWS::Region to us-east-1, so a pseudo-parameter and a literal of that region look the same; different referencing is therefore accepted on either the table form or the region value. The schema checks read an inline Definition; a DefinitionS3Location holds nothing to read and fails them. Real templates: DSV4F's two data sources are identical, and OpenCode_DSV4F names createTodo rather than addTodo; both failures are kept. data_sources_to_table requires every DynamoDB data source to name Table1 or reference something (Ref, GetAtt split, Sub); a reference is not tied to the table itself. policy_covers_indexes now requires the index grant on a role AppSync assumes."
}
